# Repository plumbing that must not travel in the published archive.
# `doc/`, `scratch/`, `referencias/` (126 MB of the upstream TypeScript tree)
# and `.github/` live at the repository root, outside this package, so pub
# never walks into them; they are listed here only so the intent is explicit
# if this package is ever moved.
.dart_tool/
doc/
doc/api/
scratch/
referencias/
.github/
test/
